{"seq":52,"slug":"causal-inference-advanced","title":"因果推断进阶","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"因果推断进阶\">因果推断进阶</h1><p>当你掌握了因果推断的基础理论——潜在结果框架、因果图、后门准则——之后，真正的挑战才刚开始：如何在高维混杂、异质处理效应、非线性干扰函数的现实场景中，稳健且高效地估计因果效应？这正是本 hub 要回答的问题。</p>\n<p>本 hub 与兄弟 hub <a href=\"../causal-inference/\">因果推断</a> 的分工边界明确：后者覆盖从相关到因果的基础概念（潜在结果、因果图、匹配、DID、工具变量等经典方法），而本 hub 聚焦于 2018 年以来因果推断与机器学习交叉领域的前沿方法——Double/Debiased Machine Learning、Causal Forests、元学习器（Meta-Learners）、以及将这些方法落地的工具生态。与 <a href=\"../ab-testing-statistics/\">A/B 测试与统计</a> 的分工在于：A/B 测试 hub 处理实验设计与检验，本 hub 则关注从观测数据中做因果推断的进阶机器学习方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>对于有 3-7 年经验的数据科学家或机器学习工程师：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>基础篇</strong>（第一章）：从半参数效率理论和 Neyman 正交性出发，理解为什么传统 ML 直接用于因果推断会产生正则化偏差，以及正交化如何解决这个问题。</li>\n<li><strong>方法篇</strong>（第二章）：深入 Double Machine Learning 的完整流程、交叉拟合策略、以及 R-Learner 和 DR-Learner 两种正交化估计器。</li>\n<li><strong>现代篇</strong>（第三章）：掌握 Causal Forests（GRF 框架）、元学习器家族（S/T/X-Learner）、以及连续处理变量的广义倾向得分方法。</li>\n<li><strong>实践篇</strong>（第四章）：学会使用 DoWhy + EconML + CausalPy 工具栈，掌握敏感性分析与稳健性检验，最终在真实业务中落地因果 ML 管线。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>概率论与数理统计（条件期望、大数定律、中心极限定理）</li>\n<li>机器学习基础（随机森林、梯度提升、交叉验证）</li>\n<li>因果推断基础（潜在结果框架、ATE/CATE、混杂与选择偏差）——见 <a href=\"../causal-inference/causal-fundamentals/\">因果推断基础</a></li>\n<li>Python 编程能力（NumPy/Pandas/scikit-learn 级别）</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"semiparametric-efficiency","title":"半参数效率理论与因果推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/foundations/semiparametric-efficiency"},{"seq":2,"slug":"neyman-orthogonality","title":"Neyman 正交性与去偏机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/foundations/neyman-orthogonality"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-fitting","title":"交叉拟合与样本分割策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/foundations/cross-fitting"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"methods","title":"正交化方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"double-ml","title":"Double Machine Learning 完整流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/methods/double-ml"},{"seq":2,"slug":"r-learner","title":"R-Learner 与残差学习框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/methods/r-learner"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dr-learner","title":"DR-Learner 与双重稳健 CATE 估计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/methods/dr-learner"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern","title":"现代因果机器学习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/modern","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"causal-forests","title":"Causal Forests 与 GRF 框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/modern/causal-forests"},{"seq":2,"slug":"meta-learners","title":"元学习器家族：S/T/X/DR-Learner","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/modern/meta-learners"},{"seq":3,"slug":"continuous-treatment","title":"连续处理与广义倾向得分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/modern/continuous-treatment"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工具与实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dowhy-econml","title":"DoWhy 与 EconML 工具生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/practice/dowhy-econml"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sensitivity-analysis","title":"敏感性分析与稳健性检验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/practice/sensitivity-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"causal-ml-pipeline","title":"因果 ML 管线设计与落地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/practice/causal-ml-pipeline"}]}]}